  "content": "<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/2GB3QhtXb4I?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span><br><span style=\"color:#f00\">需要 <a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creativecore\" rel=\"nofollow\">CreativeCore</a></span></p><p><span>此模組最初由 SonicJumper 創作（原始討論串可於</span><a style=\"background-color:#ffffff\" href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/minecraft-mods/wip-mods/1442984-1-6-2-enhanced-visuals-v0-3-deprecated-updated-8\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a><span>找到）。</span></p><p>EnhancedVisuals 透過在 HUD 上加入效果，提供更具沉浸感的遊戲體驗。</p><p><strong>Optifine</strong><br>若要與 Optifine 同時使用 EnhancedVisuals，必須關閉快速渲染、非等向性過濾與反鋸齒功能，否則部分效果啟動時畫面會變黑。</p><p><strong>材質包<br></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/enhancedvisual-pixelated\" rel=\"nofollow\">EnhancedVisuals 像素風</a><br>（已過時）nox_cgt 創作的像素風 EnhancedVisuals <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.dropbox.com%252fs%252fhiypntguq6ry40h%252fPixelated%2bEnhancedVisuals%2bby%2bnox_cgt.zip%253fdl%253d1\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">正在尋找可以和朋友一起玩的伺服器嗎？我們的贊助商已為您準備好了：</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fteamcreative\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/logos/dark_text@1538x500.png\" width=\"237\" height=\"77\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">使用優惠碼 <strong>teamcreative</strong>，在任一遊戲伺服器上首次訂閱可享 25% 折扣！</p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Y8zkibd.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"377\" height=\"212\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/5OFKGb1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"378\" height=\"213\"></p><p><strong>適用於 <a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/tough-as-nails\" rel=\"nofollow\">ToughAsNails</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simpledifficulty\" rel=\"nofollow\">SimpleDifficulty</a> 的擴充套件</strong></p><p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/syjOViAN-N4?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/creativemd\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/g2vJewK.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"263\" height=\"61\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/creativemd\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;</a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/W9QM3fS\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/YF5WrZ1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"154\" height=\"75\"></a></p>",
